@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api/v1
@contentType = application/json
@authToken = your_admin_jwt_token_here

### Public Routes ###

### Get all comments for a blog post (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/comments/blog/123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000?page=1&limit=10

### Get all comments by a user (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/comments/user/123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000?page=1&limit=10

### Authenticated Routes ###

### Create a new comment (Authenticated)
POST {{baseUrl}}/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "content": "This is a great article!",
  "blogId": "123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000"
}

### Update a comment (Comment owner only)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/comments/123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "content": "This is an updated comment!"
}

### Delete a comment (Comment owner only)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/comments/123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}} 